          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo luŋ te wot toŋo jaŋ yen, ote bino gero kede gonye, kun ŋat acel acel gero mege kene i dyekal me ode, i dyekal me ot a Rwot, i dyekal ame tye i nyim dogcel ame olwoŋo ni dogcel me Pii, kede en ame olwoŋo ni dogcel me Epraim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak luŋ ame rik onwoŋo odwogo iyi opii ogero obedo oko i bomagi. Lwak luŋ rik te cokere i cuny acel i dyekal i nyim dogcel ame olwoŋo ni dogcel me Pii; gin ocokere kuno i nino dwe acel me dwe-nono, Gin te penyo Ejira alamdog, ame apwony cik Obaŋa, cik ame rik Rwot omio baŋ jo Icrael, kun mio baŋ Muca, ni myero en kel buk me cikkono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
